  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GLB WASH Greening Donor Retreat Cook Con</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In the frame of the Strategy on Switzerland&#x2019;s International Cooperation 2021-2024, 4 priority themes have been defined for the SDC/HA domain, namely DRR, Food security, WASH and Protection. The WASH unit is hosted by the Africa H division. This aim of this Credit Proposal is to give a frame to envisaged Partial Actions to increase impact and coherence of the SDC/HA global humanitarian response state of the art WASH programming as defined in the operational concept WASH 2021 &#x2013; 2024.</narrative>
  </description>
